      "writtenOn": "2024-03-28T04:31:55Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Should it really be allowed to register a key without a hostname ? Do you have a reference to the spec ?\nIIUC this is about keeping ownership of the registration until the device comes back, but the original registration must have had a hostname too.",
